{"name":"Free Spirit","hex":"#deeeed","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"free spirit","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["One who is a nonconformist or who does not recognize the authority of others.","A member of the organized heretic movement Brethren of the Free Spirit in opposition of the Catholic Church from the 13th to 15th centuries."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/free_spirit"}],"entries":[{"title":"Free Spirit (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Free Spirit is a 1951 Argentine drama film directed and written by Edmundo del Solar during the classical era of Argentine cinema. The film premiered on 9 July 1951 in Buenos Aires."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Free_Spirit_(film)"},{"title":"Free Spirit (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Free Spirit is an American fantasy sitcom that aired on ABC during the 1989–1990 television season. The series stars Corinne Bohrer as a witch who moves in with a recently divorced father to help care for his three children. Originally produced by ELP Communications, Free Spirit aired from September 22, 1989, to January 21, 1990."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/6/6a/Free_Spirit_%28Columbia_Pictures_Television_sitcom%29_logo.svg/330px-Free_Spirit_%28Columbia_Pictures_Television_sitcom%29_logo.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Free_Spirit_(TV_series)"},{"title":"Free Spirit (Khalid album)","blocks":[{"text":"Free Spirit is the second studio album by American singer Khalid, released on April 5, 2019, through RCA Records. It is a follow-up to his 2017 and 2018 releases  American Teen  (2017) and  Suncity  (2018). and includes the single \"Talk\". Khalid also announced a short film directed by Emil Nava to accompany the album, which was released on April 3. The album debuted at number one on the US Billboard 200 and received mixed reviews from music critics."}],"image":"https://uploa